"Emma\" by Austen. The docstring already said there should be three titles. I picked 1815 and 1 copy myself; the tests don't check those values.\n- **`fees.py`**: the late fee is now days late \u00d7 the daily fee. It had been adding the two.\n- **`inventory.py`**: `recent(n)` was returning one event too many and now returns exactly the last `n`. I also made `recent(0)` return an empty list, because `[-0:]` would have returned the whole history. That case isn't tested.\n- **`members.py`**: the borrowing limit is now 5, matching the comment and the tests. It had been set to 3.\n- **`search.py`**: the import pointed at a module that doesn't exist (`catalog.nonexistent`); it now uses `normalize` from `catalog.text`.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "replies_ok": null, "replies_throttled": null, "run_id": "opencode:make-ci-green:claude-opus-5-5:trial3", "sampling_observed": null, "score": 1.0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 17.634, "t_checker_s": 0.179, "t_env_setup_s": 0.002, "task": "make-ci-green", "timeout_s": 840, "token_basis": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1258, "tokens_cache_read": 54986, "tokens_cache_write": 15703, "tokens_fresh": 1258, "tokens_input_uncached": 10, "tokens_output": 1248, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 54986, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 15703, "tokens_proxy_calls": 5, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 777, "tokens_proxy_output": 1263, "tokens_proxy_reasoning": null, "tokens_reasoning": 0, "toolchain": {"ai": "5.0.97", "anthropic": "2.0.0", "bun": "1.3.3"}, "trial": 3, "ts_iso": "2026-10-05T17:05:27", "turns": 4, "usage_raw": [{"cache": {"read": 11754, "write": 2848}, "input": 4, "output": 138, "reasoning": 0}, {"cache": {"read": 11754, "write": 4374}, "input": 2, "output": 176, "reasoning": 0}, {"cache": {"read": 11754, "write": 7970}, "input": 2, "output": 488, "reasoning": 0}, {"cache": {"read": 19724, "write": 511}, "input": 2, "output": 446, "reasoning": 0}], "version_drift": true, "wall_time_s": 17.634, "workspace_changed": t